          {
            "subj": "Infinitive (to+v)",
            "form": "Verb + to + V",
            "ex": "He decided <strong>to travel</strong> abroad."
          },
          {
            "subj": "Stop (فرق المعنى)",
            "form": "stop + v.ing = توقف",
            "ex": "She stopped <strong>smoking</strong>. (تركت التدخين)"
          },
          {
            "subj": "Stop (فرق المعنى)",
            "form": "stop + to + V = توقف كي",
            "ex": "She stopped <strong>to smoke</strong>. (توقفت لتدخن)"
          }
        ],
        "exception": {
          "title": "⚠️ Remember & Forget",
          "body": "<strong>Remember + v.ing</strong>: تذكر شيئاً حدث سابقاً — I remember <strong>meeting</strong> him.<br>\n                <strong>Remember + to+V</strong>: لا تنسَ أن تفعل — Remember <strong>to lock</strong> the door.<br>\n                <strong>Forget + v.ing</strong>: نسي شيئاً حدث — I'll never forget <strong>seeing</strong> that movie.<br>\n                <strong>Forget + to+V</strong>: نسي أن يفعل — He forgot <strong>to buy</strong> milk."
